{
 "encounter_id": "00669",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. I'm Joan's carer, and we're here for her yearly over-seventy-fives check."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning. Joan, how have you been, in general? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm fine. I do wish people would stop fussing. But since you ask, the forgetting is getting worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What sort of things do you forget?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Names, mostly. Where I've put my glasses. And last week I left the kettle on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She's done it twice, doctor, the kettle. And she repeats herself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Anything else you've noticed? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My knees ache, particularly on the stairs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both knees?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both, though the right is worse. And my hearing's going, I'm sure, though Maureen says it's just that I don't listen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's both, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any falls in the last year?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No falls. I'm very careful."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And have you lost weight, or has your appetite changed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm eating well. Maureen's cooking sees to that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg once a day, and paracetamol, 500 mg, when her knees are bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None. I've been lucky."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, and osteoarthritis in the knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never smoked in my life. I have a sherry at Christmas, a small one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She walks round the block daily, with her stick. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. And any breathlessness, chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing of that sort."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your knees. Can you straighten that leg?",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's some creaking, a crunch, in both knees when they bend, but no swelling or heat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it wear and tear? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That fits with osteoarthritis. As for the memory, a lot of things can cause forgetfulness, and I can't rule out early memory loss, which is why I'd like to look at it properly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dementia, you mean. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I don't want to put a label on it, Joan. I'd like a short memory test, today, if you're willing, and some blood tests to rule out simple causes, like vitamin B12 or thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't mind. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll sit with her. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like her hearing checked too, but that's a separate booking. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Right, I'll ask at the desk. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Until the results, please don't leave the kettle unattended. Maybe a kettle with an automatic switch-off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll buy one this week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, to talk through the tests."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
